Domain Entity CalendarDate
    documentation "The type of scheduled or unscheduled event for the day."
    date Date
        documentation "The month, day, and year of the calendar event."
        is part of identity
    descriptor CalendarEvent
        documentation "The type of scheduled or unscheduled event for the day."
        is required collection
    domain entity Calendar
        documentation "Reference to the calendar associated to the calendar event."
        is part of identity
